# Family Tree Viewer: what belongs to one family's computer and must never be published.
# A pattern without a leading "/" matches at any depth, on purpose: a stray copy is ignored too.

# Made from the family's Word documents by tools/Update-FamilyTree.ps1
data/

# Private material on the family's computer (real-data checks, notes, the private handoff)
dev/

# The family's own settings (names, line letters, report address), and any copy or backup of them
# ("family-settings - Copy.js", "family-settings.old.js", "family-settings.js.bak", ...).
# Only the made-up example is public. Start from family-settings.example.js.
family-settings*.js
family-settings*.bak
family-settings*.js.*
!family-settings.example.js
*.bak

# Private handoff notes (kept in dev/private/; this name has held private notes before, at any depth)
HANDOFF.md

# The program updater's working folders on the family's computer
updates/
program-previous/

# Where the documents are, when they are not in the folder above the viewer
tools/settings.txt

# Real documents never belong in the repository (the tests make their own, outside it)
*.docx
*.doc
~$*

# Test and release output. The scripts write to %TEMP% by default; these catch output pointed here.
/release/
/out/
/test-output/
FamilyTree-Tests-*/
FamilyTree-CompareTrees-*/
FamilyTree-Release/
*.zip
*.zip.sha256
*.tmp

# Editor and Windows leftovers
.vs/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
